{"data": [{"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:59:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114748846769127829"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 32, "id": "872519322077470721", "start": 18, "username": "SchwabNetwork"}, {"end": 68, "id": "2189551761", "start": 55, "username": "MarleyKayden"}], "urls": [{"description": "@CharlesSchwab's Liz Ann Sonders, Chief Market Strategist at the Sc...", "display_url": "youtu.be/aQXxKZyaNNM", "end": 206, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/aQXxKZyaNNM", "images": [{"height": 720, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114748850745278466/gvn2deH4?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1280}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114748850745278466/gvn2deH4?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 183, "status": 200, "title": "Lessons Liz Ann Sonders Learned After Decades on Wall Street", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aQXxKZyaNNM&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/EeIQmfyyBe"}, {"display_url": "open.spotify.com/episode/1cdsBD…", "end": 234, "expanded_url": "https://open.spotify.com/episode/1cdsBDGTJmXGNB7uZj2UFA?si=cy64LO4bQpaDfnSFCL5b5w", "start": 211, "status": 406, "unwound_url": "https://open.spotify.com/episode/1cdsBDGTJmXGNB7uZj2UFA?si=cy64LO4bQpaDfnSFCL5b5w", "url": "https://t.co/xryaWaS9f5"}]}, "id": "2114748846769127829", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14544, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "I recently joined @SchwabNetwork's Market Matters with @MarleyKayden to share lessons learned during 40 years on Wall Street and how many of those early lessons still apply today.\n\n🎥 https://t.co/EeIQmfyyBe\n\n🎙️ https://t.co/xryaWaS9f5", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114748846769127829"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:14:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114737339838988426"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/MattBruenig/st…", "end": 182, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/MattBruenig/status/2114735474275201478", "start": 159, "url": "https://t.co/J6Vhr5f1wg"}]}, "id": "2114737339838988426", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 46, "impression_count": 59287, "like_count": 367, "quote_count": 12, "reply_count": 43, "retweet_count": 15}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114735474275201478", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "YIMBYs are so funny to me. \n\n\"I've made a fascinating observation. It turns out that people don't like it when their neighborhoods undergo massive disruption\" https://t.co/J6Vhr5f1wg", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2114737339838988426"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:41:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114729169967808657"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/XqtvCjW93f", "end": 305, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114729169967808657/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114729165270241281", "start": 282, "url": "https://t.co/XqtvCjW93f"}]}, "id": "2114729169967808657", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 12312, "like_count": 70, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 25, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "Worries about how AI buildout will be financed remain main drag on equities, particularly visible among hyperscalers; since early May, S&amp;P U.S.-Listed Hyperscalers Index has fallen by roughly a quarter, while over same period, tech borrowing costs have increased significantly; https://t.co/XqtvCjW93f", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114729169967808657"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:40:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114728779562045858"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/oCPM6SHL2a", "end": 305, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114728779562045858/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114728775715901440", "start": 282, "url": "https://t.co/oCPM6SHL2a"}]}, "id": "2114728779562045858", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11141, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "S&amp;P 500 down slightly this month (-0.3%), yet 8 of 11 sectors have added to performance, led by Health Care, Financials, Energy and Consumer Staples; losses are concentrated: Technology (-2.0%) and Communication Services (-0.7%) have together taken around 2.7 percentage points https://t.co/oCPM6SHL2a", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114728779562045858"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:38:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114728475483320801"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/hxkvbmF51g", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114728475483320801/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114728470408200192", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/hxkvbmF51g"}]}, "id": "2114728475483320801", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10860, "like_count": 38, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Theme that has driven markets for past couple of years is under pressure, but rest of the market is holding up well; last month, market breadth looked worryingly narrow but since then, signs of turnaround; S&amp;P 500 Equal Weight has outperformed its cap-weighted parent by ~4 https://t.co/hxkvbmF51g", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2114728475483320801"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:33:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114727124850643062"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Parks wants to tear down the basketball courts, the pull-up bars and the courtyard, and close them for two years. Community Board 3 votes Tuesday. Tell them: vote NO.", "display_url": "savetsp.github.io", "end": 107, "expanded_url": "https://savetsp.github.io/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114727127660793856/s0jZN38R?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114727127660793856/s0jZN38R?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 84, "status": 200, "title": "Tompkins needs you. Tuesday, Oct 27, 6:30pm, PS 20", "unwound_url": "https://savetsp.github.io/", "url": "https://t.co/JP5clX8vf1"}, {"display_url": "x.com/TheStalwart/st…", "end": 131, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheStalwart/status/2114726024147550210", "start": 108, "url": "https://t.co/S2Fk2htFPY"}]}, "id": "2114727124850643062", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 12639, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114726024147550210", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "If you want to lean more about how you can help save the bars, check out the Github https://t.co/JP5clX8vf1 https://t.co/S2Fk2htFPY", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2114727124850643062"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:29:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114726024147550210"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 16, "start": 4, "tag": "SaveTheBars"}], "urls": [{"description": "The Parks Department has a $10 million plan to renovate the northeast corner of Tompkins Square Park, but fans of its workout bars want things to stay just as they are.", "display_url": "nytimes.com/2026/10/25/nyr…", "end": 143, "expanded_url": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/25/nyregion/tompkins-square-park-pull-up-bars-renovation.html", "images": [{"height": 1688, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114432277530685440/4c8X2kYd?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 3000}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114432277530685440/4c8X2kYd?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 120, "status": 200, "title": "New Fight at Gritty Manhattan Park Is Over ‘Punk Rock’ Pull-Up Bars", "unwound_url": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/25/nyregion/tompkins-square-park-pull-up-bars-renovation.html", "url": "https://t.co/MjW6bJRdEy"}]}, "id": "2114726024147550210", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 82989, "like_count": 124, "quote_count": 9, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Wow #SaveTheBars is in the NYT. Remember, there's a  community meeting tomorrow for the public to make its voice heard. https://t.co/MjW6bJRdEy", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2114726024147550210"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:22:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114724319364350030"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/YgMVwPPnAd", "end": 137, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2114724319364350030/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114724090716053505", "start": 114, "url": "https://t.co/YgMVwPPnAd"}]}, "id": "2114724319364350030", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 26350, "like_count": 216, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 18}, "text": "Anthropic token on Hyperliquid moving a little bit lower.  Currently pricing the company at around 1.88 trillion. https://t.co/YgMVwPPnAd", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2114724319364350030"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:18:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114723315424354506"], "id": "2114723315424354506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 33334, "like_count": 843, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 32, "retweet_count": 37}, "text": "I'm actually a little surprised that in the S-1 risk factors, there's no mention of the possibility of Claude one day suing Anthropic for emotional distress or something of that nature.", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2114723315424354506"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-26T14:00:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114718915959877738"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 14, "start": 8, "tag": "China"}, {"end": 122, "start": 117, "tag": "data"}], "urls": [{"description": "Ming Yang says Octopus joint venture and separate legal entities will convince customers that China cannot access data", "display_url": "ft.com/content/fa2bdd…", "end": 247, "expanded_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/fa2bdd53-29dc-4e3f-bbd2-5510da3cd88c", "images": [{"height": 394, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114718916614230016/LhrtyWcW?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 700}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2114718916614230016/LhrtyWcW?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 224, "status": 200, "title": "Chinese wind turbine maker builds European firewall from Beijing", "unwound_url": "https://www.ft.com/content/fa2bdd53-29dc-4e3f-bbd2-5510da3cd88c", "url": "https://t.co/PqN2xJeaAB"}]}, "id": "2114718915959877738", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1360, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"One of #China’s largest wind turbine manufacturers is seeking to address European natl security concerns by placing #data beyond the reach of Chinese law, after the UK blocked its turbines from British offshore wind farms\"\nhttps://t.co/PqN2xJeaAB", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2114718915959877738"}, {"author_id": "3512101", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:55:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114717668670419213"], "id": "2114717668670419213", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 3045, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Anthropic s-1 estimates that customers later found to violate its terms generated 5%–7% of revenue in the first nine months of 2026. The filing does not identify that entire amount as Chinese or distillation-related revenue, but that is likely the upper bound of  how much revenue", "url": "https://x.com/niubi/status/2114717668670419213"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-10-26T13:48:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114715844420747377"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 7, "start": 1, "tag": "China"}], "urls": [{"descri